 *
 *  This is the phone-shaped counterpart of the desktop Screen 5 inbox
 *  (ExceptionInboxPage.jsx) and deliberately tracks the same feature set:
 *  summary tiles, tab + search filtering, ageing, resolved-by/at, escalate,
